 "stimulus_html": "<figure id=\"fig04\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/438aed7b45965e42.png\" alt=\"Marian Anderson sings from the Lincoln Memorial. Behind her is a piano and its pianist and some of the audience. The rest of the audience stretches from the bottom of the Lincoln Memorial steps through Potomac Park to both sides of the reflecting pool.\">\n<figcaption>The <i>New York Times</i> April 10, 1939, edition ran the headline: “Throng Honors Marian Anderson in Concert at Lincoln Memorial” when an estimated 75,000 gathered at the Lincoln Memorial to hear the noted singer perform.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>",
 "questions": [
