     "id": 1172798,
     "content_html": "rising fascism in Europe would lead to world conflict"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172797,
     "content_html": "internal migration led to increased economic opportunity"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172800,
     "content_html": "the Democratic Party offered greater opportunity for African Americans"
    }
